.!saiv acme/adressbuch

// -u-co-phonebk selects the German phonebook tailoring (the
// spec's own worked example, SPEC.md section 5.3): o-umlaut
// collates as oe, landing Köln inside [Koe,Kof]. Under standard
// de-DE the umlaut is a secondary difference on o, so Köln
// collates like Koln -- past Kof.
..lex[de-DE-u-co-phonebk] [Koe,Kof]
stadt=

..lex[de-DE] [Koe,Kof]
standard=
